00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:14,740
(Watch on KonFlix.vip)

1
00:03:09,727 --> 00:03:11,662
(Phone Vibrates)

2
00:03:12,930 --> 00:03:13,631
Yes, Mom?

3
00:03:13,632 --> 00:03:15,112
Have you arrived in Phuket yet, dear?

4
00:03:17,268 --> 00:03:18,102
Yes, I'm here.

5
00:03:18,103 --> 00:03:21,171
Why didn’t you tell me?

6
00:03:21,172 --> 00:03:24,475
I was worried, you know.

7
00:03:24,576 --> 00:03:25,321
Mom...

8
00:03:26,210 --> 00:03:27,778
I just got off the plane.

9
00:03:27,779 --> 00:03:29,546
As long as everything worked out, that’s all that matters.

10
00:03:29,547 --> 00:03:31,214
And don’t forget.

11
00:03:31,215 --> 00:03:33,017
Don’t do anything risky.

12
00:03:34,152 --> 00:03:36,645
You don't have to be worried, I'm already here.

13
00:03:37,255 --> 00:03:39,321
And also, nothing is gonna happen, Mom.

14
00:03:39,937 --> 00:03:45,308
Don’t forget to go to the shrine like the feng shui master told you.

15
00:03:45,630 --> 00:03:47,532
Have you met Sang yet?

16
00:03:55,273 --> 00:03:56,407
Hey Mom? I gotta go now.

17
00:05:29,713 --> 00:05:34,218
Actually, life here isn’t as bad as I’d imagined.

18
00:06:13,023 --> 00:06:15,125
Hey! You!

19
00:06:16,890 --> 00:06:21,193
How could you step on another man's crown jewels?

20
00:06:21,514 --> 00:06:22,916
I... I'm so sorry!

21
00:06:24,411 --> 00:06:25,168
Wait!

22
00:06:25,566 --> 00:06:27,901
You're not even thinking of apologizing?

23
00:06:28,208 --> 00:06:29,209
You!

24
00:06:32,192 --> 00:06:33,360
You got no manners!

25
00:06:42,182 --> 00:06:43,783
I already apologized.

26
00:06:43,784 --> 00:06:45,686
But you're the one that didn't listen.

27
00:06:49,756 --> 00:06:52,726
At that volume, how would I have heard you?

28
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:55,334
Well, I already tried apologizing.

29
00:06:55,679 --> 00:06:56,956
You just didn't listen carefully.

30
00:06:57,230 --> 00:07:00,933
Well, next time, could you please try to speak louder?

31
00:07:00,934 --> 00:07:02,436
That would be great.

32
00:07:02,936 --> 00:07:04,004
Then...

33
00:07:05,538 --> 00:07:07,206
next time...

34
00:07:07,454 --> 00:07:08,655
please listen carefully.

35
00:07:09,228 --> 00:07:11,464
That would be great too.

36
00:07:18,185 --> 00:07:19,753
Serves you right!

37
00:07:39,846 --> 00:07:41,181
Hey, sis.

38
00:07:41,481 --> 00:07:42,481
Where have you been?

39
00:07:45,339 --> 00:07:46,452
Well...

40
00:07:46,453 --> 00:07:47,821
I got here since early morning.

41
00:07:48,034 --> 00:07:50,803
I thought coming home would be too boring..

42
00:07:50,891 --> 00:07:52,125
so I went to the beach.

43
00:07:53,093 --> 00:07:54,093
The beach?

44
00:07:55,562 --> 00:07:56,562
Hey!

45
00:07:57,097 --> 00:07:58,765
What are you getting riled up about?

46
00:08:00,901 --> 00:08:03,770
A girl being this loud, when will you ever find a boyfriend?

47
00:08:03,970 --> 00:08:04,970
Sang.

48
00:08:05,238 --> 00:08:08,208
And didn't you say you were going out with a client?

49
00:08:08,615 --> 00:08:10,535
That's because I was waiting to pick up Kim, Dad

50
00:08:10,751 --> 00:08:11,918
I was waiting for ages,

51
00:08:12,098 --> 00:08:13,378
I called, and he didn't pick up.

52
00:08:13,821 --> 00:08:16,525
Next time, if you're going anywhere, tell us!

53
00:08:16,550 --> 00:08:18,318
We got actual jobs to do!

54
00:08:18,865 --> 00:08:19,866
Well..

55
00:08:20,079 --> 00:08:22,348
..no one told me that someone was picking me up.

56
00:08:24,257 --> 00:08:25,425
Seriously, Kim..

57
00:08:26,206 --> 00:08:27,741
why'd your mom send you here?

58
00:08:28,041 --> 00:08:29,109
About that..

59
00:08:29,309 --> 00:08:30,743
Mom told you already you, didn't she?

60
00:08:30,804 --> 00:08:32,105
The quarter life crisis?

61
00:08:32,406 --> 00:08:35,409
Women are so gullible.

62
00:08:35,869 --> 00:08:37,002
These kinds of things..

63
00:08:37,003 --> 00:08:39,338
if you don't believe, then don't talk ill of them, Dad.

64
00:08:39,339 --> 00:08:42,008
These rich people types are all superstitious.

65
00:08:42,442 --> 00:08:43,442
And another thing..

66
00:08:43,583 --> 00:08:47,787
I don't think being a woman means you're gullible.

67
00:08:48,354 --> 00:08:51,384
Even amulet dealers are men, aren't they?

68
00:08:51,685 --> 00:08:52,685
Siw!

69
00:08:52,919 --> 00:08:54,919
Will there be a day where you don't argue with me?

70
00:08:55,055 --> 00:08:56,856
Act like the daughter I raised you to be!

71
00:08:56,923 --> 00:08:58,891
Why does my life have to be like this?

72
00:08:58,892 --> 00:09:01,895
No son, can't rely on either of my daughters..

73
00:09:02,562 --> 00:09:05,042
If there’s anything, be there to help your sister, understand?

74
00:09:05,665 --> 00:09:06,665
It's okay..

75
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:08,134
I can do it myself.

76
00:09:09,069 --> 00:09:10,637
Look at my daughters...

77
00:09:12,839 --> 00:09:13,839
Siw!

78
00:09:14,234 --> 00:09:15,836
Take your cousin to his room!

79
00:09:17,583 --> 00:09:19,318
Let's go go.

80
00:09:47,941 --> 00:09:48,781
What you looking at?

81
00:09:50,644 --> 00:09:53,279
You look good now that you're older.

82
00:09:55,882 --> 00:09:57,217
What's with you?

83
00:09:57,884 --> 00:10:01,487
Well, when you moved to Bangkok, I was still really young

84
00:10:01,488 --> 00:10:03,222
I can barely remember anything

85
00:10:03,223 --> 00:10:05,825
not even what your face looks like.

86
00:10:09,896 --> 00:10:10,896
Alright, alright...

87
00:10:11,131 --> 00:10:12,332
I'm gonna unpack.

88
00:10:17,504 --> 00:10:18,504
Wait...

89
00:10:21,908 --> 00:10:22,908
What else?

90
00:10:24,278 --> 00:10:25,946
You're really here for the inheritence?

91
00:10:48,301 --> 00:10:49,301
Just kidding!

92
00:10:50,203 --> 00:10:51,571
Don't worry..

93
00:10:52,332 --> 00:10:55,335
I'm only here for another 364 days.

94
00:10:56,342 --> 00:10:57,811
Once the year is complete,

95
00:10:58,645 --> 00:11:01,014
I'm going back to Bangkok.

96
00:11:02,282 --> 00:11:03,282
That's good.

97
00:11:03,583 --> 00:11:06,586
Because if you're gonna mess with Dad and Sang,

98
00:11:07,420 --> 00:11:09,588
I think you should take your time and work,

99
00:11:09,589 --> 00:11:12,559
.. that might be easier.

100
00:11:15,295 --> 00:11:16,529
Then...

101
00:11:17,330 --> 00:11:19,132
What do you think I should do?

102
00:11:20,166 --> 00:11:24,170
Live stream and talk to myself day by day?

103
00:11:24,304 --> 00:11:25,772
Kinda like..

104
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:28,775
Hello!

105
00:11:28,808 --> 00:11:29,943
It's Siw!

106
00:11:30,744 --> 00:11:31,678
You...

107
00:11:31,679 --> 00:11:33,412
know that I'm an influencer?

108
00:11:33,413 --> 00:11:35,014
Are you following?

109
00:11:36,182 --> 00:11:37,182
Well..

110
00:11:37,417 --> 00:11:38,417
No.

111
00:11:38,985 --> 00:11:41,321
I was just... scrolling through.

112
00:11:42,055 --> 00:11:43,056
Kay!

113
00:11:43,289 --> 00:11:44,357
I'm outta here!

114
00:11:45,692 --> 00:11:47,660
I'm actually pretty famous!

115
00:12:44,450 --> 00:12:52,450
(Phone Vibrates)

116
00:13:02,268 --> 00:13:03,436
Yes, Mom?

117
00:13:03,503 --> 00:13:06,972
Uncle told me you’d arrived but still refused to come home.

118
00:13:06,973 --> 00:13:10,877
Do you know how worried you’re making your mother?

119
00:13:11,644 --> 00:13:12,946
Mom...

120
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:15,161
you don't have to worry, okay?

121
00:13:15,776 --> 00:13:18,145
I can take care of myself.

122
00:13:19,499 --> 00:13:21,267
Once the year is up...

123
00:13:21,561 --> 00:13:23,323
I'll be back to take care of you again.

124
00:13:25,859 --> 00:13:26,960
Mom?

125
00:13:28,561 --> 00:13:29,829
I love you.

126
00:14:05,098 --> 00:14:06,266
- Daiji..
- Yeah..

127
00:14:06,499 --> 00:14:07,901
Prepare more food tomorrow, okay?

128
00:14:08,968 --> 00:14:10,770
We got guests in almost 10 rooms.

129
00:14:11,337 --> 00:14:13,339
- Almost fully booked
- Okay, can do.

130
00:14:16,809 --> 00:14:19,245
Make some Kanom Jeen too, and also..

131
00:14:19,812 --> 00:14:21,214
fish balls...

132
00:14:22,248 --> 00:14:25,251
maybe some lobster, around 10 kilos...

133
00:14:25,318 --> 00:14:27,387
Oh, okay...

134
00:14:33,626 --> 00:14:35,662
And where did Tao Sor go?

135
00:14:38,197 --> 00:14:39,332
Probably...

136
00:14:39,466 --> 00:14:41,034
out to draw outside...

137
00:14:41,755 --> 00:14:42,732
Huh?

138
00:14:42,843 --> 00:14:44,258
He's drawing outside?

139
00:14:44,938 --> 00:14:46,371
Who did he go with?

140
00:14:46,372 --> 00:14:48,374
Who let him go?

141
00:14:51,978 --> 00:14:53,979
I already told him..

142
00:14:54,060 --> 00:14:56,229
to wait for me to get the stock ready first

143
00:14:56,335 --> 00:14:57,569
but he wouldn't take it

144
00:14:57,597 --> 00:14:59,598
said he could go himself.

145
00:14:59,813 --> 00:15:01,915
He wouldn't let me tell you too!

146
00:15:10,296 --> 00:15:12,098
Tao Sor!

147
00:15:12,726 --> 00:15:14,261
Yes?

148
00:15:15,802 --> 00:15:16,869
Where have you been?

149
00:15:18,504 --> 00:15:19,939
Umm...

150
00:15:20,506 --> 00:15:22,141
I was outside

151
00:15:23,089 --> 00:15:24,924
I told you already, right?

152
00:15:25,478 --> 00:15:27,680
If you're going anywhere, you need to tell me.

153
00:15:31,284 --> 00:15:32,085
Okay, okay...

154
00:15:32,118 --> 00:15:33,118
go paint.

155
00:16:56,777 --> 00:16:57,724
How you been, Tao Sor?

156
00:16:58,412 --> 00:17:00,381
You took the car for a trip?

157
00:17:03,451 --> 00:17:04,447
This is Dr. Kluen

158
00:17:05,353 --> 00:17:08,189
he's been taking care of your conditon all this time.

159
00:17:16,870 --> 00:17:19,205
Why...

160
00:17:21,669 --> 00:17:23,771
...do I feel like I've seen this in my dreams?

161
00:17:26,273 --> 00:17:28,909
These pictures you drew...

162
00:17:29,543 --> 00:17:33,247
must be your dreams you remembered from each night.

163
00:17:34,248 --> 00:17:36,117
And...

164
00:17:39,215 --> 00:17:41,283
...as for the drawings with clear faces

165
00:17:41,308 --> 00:17:44,090
most likely came from you drawing

166
00:17:44,091 --> 00:17:46,760
and wanting to remember them

167
00:17:46,761 --> 00:17:48,461
so you drew them out in detail.

168
00:17:48,462 --> 00:17:49,463
Why...

169
00:17:49,864 --> 00:17:51,832
..can't I remember anything?

170
00:17:54,635 --> 00:17:56,303
It's okay, Tao Sor.

171
00:17:56,404 --> 00:17:58,271
You can't remember today,

172
00:17:58,272 --> 00:18:01,275
but tomorrow, you might! Who could tell?

173
00:18:01,742 --> 00:18:04,745
How long have I been like this?

174
00:18:10,518 --> 00:18:13,120
That's not important, Tao Sor!

175
00:18:15,003 --> 00:18:16,237
And...

176
00:18:16,822 --> 00:18:18,926
..will there be a day that I can remember?

177
00:18:22,337 --> 00:18:24,238
But... whatever.

178
00:18:24,732 --> 00:18:27,902
Even if I knew, I'd just forget it all tomorrow.

179
00:18:28,869 --> 00:18:31,872
Isn't it enough for you to be happy with today?

180
00:18:33,586 --> 00:18:35,789
The space for memories...

181
00:18:36,510 --> 00:18:40,581
your family will be filling in those blanks, for what you need to know.

182
00:18:41,315 --> 00:18:43,716
Whether or not you will remember,

183
00:18:43,717 --> 00:18:45,352
I want to let you know

184
00:18:46,787 --> 00:18:49,290
that everyone loves you and cares about you always.

185
00:18:52,626 --> 00:18:53,626
Okay.

186
00:19:05,806 --> 00:19:08,809
There's a large ship booking today, Dad

187
00:19:09,009 --> 00:19:10,525
I was thinking that I'll go too.

188
00:19:11,679 --> 00:19:12,980
Let Gim take care of that!

189
00:19:13,940 --> 00:19:15,075
Put him to work for once

190
00:19:15,402 --> 00:19:16,603
I'll tell him myself.

191
00:19:17,557 --> 00:19:18,892
Don't bother, Dad.

192
00:19:19,186 --> 00:19:21,155
It's my job, I can do it myself.

193
00:19:22,223 --> 00:19:23,223
What about Siw?

194
00:19:24,191 --> 00:19:25,759
Probably not awake yet?

195
00:19:28,022 --> 00:19:29,089
Both of my daughters...

196
00:19:29,216 --> 00:19:30,450
each such a case.

197
00:19:31,105 --> 00:19:32,572
Your nephew's also the same

198
00:19:32,753 --> 00:19:34,255
I can't see much difference.

199
00:19:38,759 --> 00:19:39,894
I've got it!

200
00:19:44,011 --> 00:19:46,647
I'm going to do a 1 day trip here.

201
00:19:47,281 --> 00:19:48,349
What kind of trip?

202
00:19:54,421 --> 00:19:55,522
Taking tourists...

203
00:19:55,523 --> 00:19:57,825
to come learn local cooking.

204
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:07,902
I'll be back, sis.

205
00:20:17,419 --> 00:20:18,419
Daiji,

206
00:20:18,420 --> 00:20:21,690
could you help me try this?
- Can do!

207
00:20:30,031 --> 00:20:31,005
Woah!

208
00:20:31,339 --> 00:20:32,774
This is on point!

209
00:20:33,507 --> 00:20:35,132
Woah, so delicious!

210
00:20:35,910 --> 00:20:37,478
Good!

211
00:20:42,610 --> 00:20:43,501
Delicious!

212
00:20:54,189 --> 00:20:55,856
You remembered?

213
00:20:55,857 --> 00:20:58,092
That I don't eat spicy foods in the morning.

214
00:20:58,093 --> 00:20:59,293
Oh...

215
00:20:59,294 --> 00:21:02,597
Daiji told me to get Dry Boiled Rice for you.

216
00:21:07,836 --> 00:21:09,037
So I see.

217
00:21:11,573 --> 00:21:13,274
Menu, Sir.

218
00:21:26,486 --> 00:21:27,753
Tell your chef to go ahead.

219
00:21:28,079 --> 00:21:31,383
Anything that your chef makes best.

220
00:22:42,883 --> 00:22:44,184
Excuse me!

221
00:22:51,481 --> 00:22:53,182
Could you bring the owner here?

222
00:22:53,183 --> 00:22:54,918
If you had anything, you can tell me.

223
00:22:55,852 --> 00:22:57,287
I want to talk to the owner.

224
00:22:59,856 --> 00:23:00,856
Okay!

225
00:23:07,764 --> 00:23:08,899
Um, excuse me?

226
00:23:09,332 --> 00:23:10,934
Are there any problems with the food?

227
00:23:21,731 --> 00:23:23,699
You're the owner here?

228
00:23:24,848 --> 00:23:27,249
I'm the one who made this dish for you.

229
00:23:27,250 --> 00:23:29,410
If there's anything you don't like, you could tell me.

230
00:23:30,887 --> 00:23:32,823
So you're a chef, huh?

231
00:23:35,031 --> 00:23:36,666
Good!

232
00:23:36,900 --> 00:23:39,035
Will you be interested in doing a project with me?

233
00:23:46,102 --> 00:23:47,182
Is there anything going on?

234
00:23:47,571 --> 00:23:48,705
So...

235
00:23:49,573 --> 00:23:52,175
I tasted the food here and I feel like the flavour is...

236
00:23:56,446 --> 00:23:57,981
...so delicious!

237
00:23:58,882 --> 00:24:02,319
It made me think about when I was here with my brother when I was young.

238
00:24:02,919 --> 00:24:05,322
So I want to hold a 1 day trip here,

239
00:24:05,689 --> 00:24:07,957
so I can bring tourists to come learn how to cook.

240
00:24:07,958 --> 00:24:10,961
This way, everyone would be able to know your food as well.

241
00:24:15,966 --> 00:24:18,467
If you want something, please come talk to me this way

242
00:24:18,468 --> 00:24:20,302
I'm the one who makes all the decisions here.

243
00:24:20,303 --> 00:24:22,038
We can just talk here!

244
00:24:24,407 --> 00:24:26,046
You've seem to have lost your manners

245
00:24:26,169 --> 00:24:28,770
coming here, doing some weird test

246
00:24:28,795 --> 00:24:31,231
and being delusional thinking you'll do this and that here.

247
00:24:31,848 --> 00:24:33,116
And what do you think?

248
00:24:33,617 --> 00:24:36,318
This is probably better than your resort

249
00:24:36,319 --> 00:24:38,587
in case the tourists who come like it here,

250
00:24:38,588 --> 00:24:39,588
and decide to stay here.

251
00:24:44,094 --> 00:24:45,295
Daiji!

252
00:24:47,497 --> 00:24:48,465
What's up?

253
00:24:48,466 --> 00:24:50,332
I'm letting Daiji look after this project.

254
00:24:50,333 --> 00:24:51,333
No.

255
00:24:51,835 --> 00:24:54,303
I need the chef who made this dish for me

256
00:24:54,304 --> 00:24:56,206
be the one in charge.

257
00:25:00,377 --> 00:25:01,778
What do you think?

258
00:25:02,345 --> 00:25:04,385
Are you interested in joining this project with me?

259
00:25:08,785 --> 00:25:11,053
Hey, you don't know anything

260
00:25:11,054 --> 00:25:12,822
better not to get involved.

261
00:25:14,157 --> 00:25:17,159
If you won't take my offer of having Chef Daiji teach,

262
00:25:17,160 --> 00:25:18,694
then you're welcome to leave.

263
00:25:18,695 --> 00:25:19,863
Daiji.

264
00:25:20,697 --> 00:25:21,997
Take Tao Sor to go rest.

265
00:25:21,998 --> 00:25:22,899
Okay.

266
00:25:22,900 --> 00:25:24,267
Let's go!

267
00:25:25,335 --> 00:25:26,335
Wait!

268
00:25:35,745 --> 00:25:38,415
I'd rather hear the answer from the chef's own mouth.

269
00:25:54,965 --> 00:25:56,800
I'm going to do this project.

270
00:25:58,268 --> 00:25:59,835
Good! In that case,

271
00:25:59,836 --> 00:26:02,605
Next week I'm going to bring my first tour group here.

272
00:26:04,307 --> 00:26:05,307
As for you...

273
00:26:06,643 --> 00:26:07,643
Next time,

274
00:26:09,312 --> 00:26:10,613
give me a banger.

275
00:26:20,042 --> 00:26:21,544
But really...

276
00:26:22,935 --> 00:26:25,337
Letting Tao Sor try something new,

277
00:26:25,641 --> 00:26:26,930
is a good thing, you know?

278
00:26:27,197 --> 00:26:30,500
But I'm afraid that kid is gonna become a problem for Tao Sor.

279
00:26:32,502 --> 00:26:33,775
Why would you worry?

280
00:26:34,571 --> 00:26:37,407
We've taken care of Tao Sor for 10 years already!

281
00:26:37,766 --> 00:26:40,302
We've been through dark moments so many times.

282
00:26:40,777 --> 00:26:43,279
Something as small like this, we'll be able to get through.

283
00:26:58,528 --> 00:26:59,528
Kim!

284
00:27:01,164 --> 00:27:02,698
After being outside all day,

285
00:27:02,699 --> 00:27:03,900
what have you brought back?

286
00:27:11,174 --> 00:27:12,341
I think..

287
00:27:12,342 --> 00:27:15,345
you, can start finding clients for my tour.

288
00:27:15,812 --> 00:27:18,213
Because, I've found a place that teaches cooking.

289
00:27:18,214 --> 00:27:20,116
It's real hot, I'm telling you.

290
00:27:25,221 --> 00:27:26,489
I'm sorry?

291
00:27:27,857 --> 00:27:29,893
Who said I'd find clients for you?

292
00:27:31,061 --> 00:27:32,561
If you're gonna do something yourself,

293
00:27:32,562 --> 00:27:34,497
then be able to do it all!

294
00:27:38,415 --> 00:27:40,917
For the only male heir of the clan,

295
00:27:41,984 --> 00:27:43,986
something like this shouldn't be difficult.

296
00:27:49,345 --> 00:27:50,380
Okay!

297
00:27:51,481 --> 00:27:53,183
Just wait and see...

298
00:28:20,977 --> 00:28:25,715
(Phone Vibrates)

299
00:28:27,083 --> 00:28:27,984
Yes, Mom?

300
00:28:27,985 --> 00:28:29,886
Have you eaten yet, dear?

301
00:28:32,021 --> 00:28:33,321
Yes, I have.

302
00:28:35,258 --> 00:28:36,925
Oh! Mom?

303
00:28:36,926 --> 00:28:39,862
I went to eat at a place today.

304
00:28:39,863 --> 00:28:40,863
So delicious!

305
00:28:41,164 --> 00:28:43,566
It tasted like my childhood, where..

306
00:28:46,970 --> 00:28:47,971
Uh...

307
00:28:48,404 --> 00:28:49,038
let's just say

308
00:28:49,039 --> 00:28:51,039
it still can't beat the food at Bangkok.

309
00:28:51,040 --> 00:28:54,800
There's tons of great places everywhere in Bangkok, you don;t have to fly down here to Phuket.

310
00:28:57,419 --> 00:29:00,856
Have you gone to the shrine yet?

311
00:29:03,219 --> 00:29:04,620
Yes...

312
00:29:04,621 --> 00:29:06,421
..in about..

313
00:29:06,422 --> 00:29:08,925
2 -3 days I was thinking of going.

314
00:29:09,692 --> 00:29:13,530
The deity there's kind and easygoing, right?

315
00:29:15,131 --> 00:29:16,533
Then..

316
00:29:16,933 --> 00:29:18,801
I'm going to freshen up and go to bed, okay?

317
00:29:19,502 --> 00:29:20,637
That's all.

318
00:29:22,539 --> 00:29:23,539
Good night, Mom.

319
00:29:23,540 --> 00:29:25,842
Good night.

320
00:31:02,579 --> 00:31:03,368
Tao Sor.

321
00:31:05,182 --> 00:31:05,918
My name's Talay

322
00:31:06,772 --> 00:31:08,080
I'm your brother.

323
00:31:09,562 --> 00:31:10,813
Mom and Dad are waiting downstairs.

324
00:31:11,609 --> 00:31:12,786
Get showered quick

325
00:31:13,306 --> 00:31:15,247
I'll show you around the house.

326
00:31:25,545 --> 00:31:27,512
Our family runs a resort.

327
00:31:27,513 --> 00:31:29,347
Normally, you'll help out in the kitchen.

328
00:31:29,348 --> 00:31:31,116
You might not remember,

329
00:31:31,117 --> 00:31:34,120
but you make amazing Thai and Chinese food.

330
00:31:36,196 --> 00:31:38,931
As for the other cuisines, Chef Daiji will be in charge

331
00:31:38,956 --> 00:31:41,292
and he'll help you with everything.

332
00:31:43,462 --> 00:31:47,099
So today there will be a tourist couple coming to learn cooking with you.

333
00:31:49,248 --> 00:31:50,815
Huh? With..with me?

334
00:31:52,677 --> 00:31:55,013
It's okay, no need to worry.

335
00:31:55,548 --> 00:31:57,517
Today's menu is Mie Hokkian,

336
00:31:57,641 --> 00:32:00,067
a menu you could make with your eyes closed.

337
00:32:00,385 --> 00:32:01,101
Isn't that right?

338
00:32:02,041 --> 00:32:04,377
I do know how to make it,

339
00:32:06,124 --> 00:32:07,459
I don't know how to teach.

340
00:32:09,828 --> 00:32:10,863
What should we do?

341
00:32:11,515 --> 00:32:13,192
This way, follow me!

342
00:32:16,329 --> 00:32:20,465
So ladies and gentlemen, welcome to Siam Cuisine.

343
00:32:20,466 --> 00:32:22,668
The exclusive honeymoon kitchen.

344
00:32:25,170 --> 00:32:26,170
Um...

345
00:32:27,807 --> 00:32:29,475
I might have to ask to cancel for today.

346
00:32:32,278 --> 00:32:33,278
Wait, hey.

347
00:32:33,546 --> 00:32:34,579
How could you do this?

348
00:32:34,580 --> 00:32:35,781
My clients are already here.

349
00:32:40,887 --> 00:32:42,889
All the ingredients are laid out and prepared, no?

350
00:32:45,625 --> 00:32:46,926
But our chef isn't ready yet.

351
00:32:47,793 --> 00:32:49,962
If you want Tao Sor, it has to be another day.

352
00:32:50,897 --> 00:32:53,198
But if you're set on today,

353
00:32:53,199 --> 00:32:54,901
I'll have Chef Daiji be the one teaching.

354
00:32:58,437 --> 00:32:59,705
One minute please.

355
00:33:10,316 --> 00:33:11,316
Hey, you.

356
00:33:12,218 --> 00:33:13,218
We're all grown up

357
00:33:13,753 --> 00:33:15,021
have some responsibility.

358
00:33:15,321 --> 00:33:17,089
We talked that day, didn't we?

359
00:33:17,390 --> 00:33:18,758
You made an agreement with me.

360
00:33:18,925 --> 00:33:20,660
Why are acting like you don't remember.

361
00:33:23,663 --> 00:33:24,664
Hey, sir.

362
00:33:25,364 --> 00:33:26,832
It's the same either way.

363
00:33:27,391 --> 00:33:28,860
Could you not make this a big deal?

364
00:33:30,002 --> 00:33:31,002
It's okay.

365
00:33:33,191 --> 00:33:34,292
I'll teach.

366
00:33:34,907 --> 00:33:37,109
Okay, that means we're clear?

367
00:33:38,210 --> 00:33:39,779
Sir, Ma'am? Please come inside.

368
00:33:47,920 --> 00:33:49,388
You slice off the shallot,

369
00:33:49,689 --> 00:33:51,991
I want to you to cut it by yourself.

370
00:33:52,391 --> 00:33:53,459
Because.

371
00:33:54,593 --> 00:33:55,774
I want you to stand

372
00:33:56,148 --> 00:33:57,616
the smell of the shallot.

373
00:33:59,686 --> 00:34:03,488
This will make it taste better.

374
00:34:10,519 --> 00:34:12,032
Could you slice and look at the camera?

375
00:34:12,445 --> 00:34:14,146
With confidence.

376
00:34:20,086 --> 00:34:21,887
Are you even a real chef?

377
00:34:29,929 --> 00:34:32,031
Can I get a confident expression?

378
00:34:38,070 --> 00:34:39,438
Look at the camera too, this one.

379
00:34:41,307 --> 00:34:43,542
Ah, and slice, you have to slice too.

380
00:34:49,715 --> 00:34:51,017
Blood!

381
00:34:54,587 --> 00:34:56,187
- Tao Sor!
- Come here.

382
00:34:56,188 --> 00:34:57,423
Is it serious?

383
00:34:58,124 --> 00:35:01,060
- Daiji, go get the first aid kit
- Okay.

384
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:09,567
Does it hurt alot?

385
00:35:09,568 --> 00:35:10,608
Hold on for a while, okay?

386
00:35:27,738 --> 00:35:28,398
You're good?

387
00:35:32,344 --> 00:35:33,078
Tao Sor.

388
00:35:33,252 --> 00:35:34,419
Go rest first.

389
00:35:34,686 --> 00:35:36,246
We'll have Daiji take care of the rest.

390
00:35:36,935 --> 00:35:37,935
Hey man.

391
00:35:38,343 --> 00:35:39,377
It's just a little cut.

392
00:35:40,491 --> 00:35:41,758
I think Tao Sor's still got it.

393
00:35:41,806 --> 00:35:42,874
- Right?
- Hey.

394
00:35:43,969 --> 00:35:45,670
What's your deal with Tao Sor?

395
00:35:47,985 --> 00:35:48,986
Are you okay?

396
00:35:53,165 --> 00:35:54,900
Yeah, everything is okay.

397
00:35:58,822 --> 00:35:59,456
You know.

398
00:35:59,834 --> 00:36:04,857
We actually came here to be taught cooking by you.

399
00:36:06,811 --> 00:36:11,283
We were actually here last year, try your food, it was incredible, it was amazing.

400
00:36:11,930 --> 00:36:15,266
So, we wanted to come back again and cook with you.

401
00:36:16,267 --> 00:36:19,871
Yeah, I just wanted to cook some nice food for my boyfriend.

402
00:36:20,958 --> 00:36:24,328
Do you remember last year when he complimented you?

403
00:36:32,990 --> 00:36:36,194
You don't remember, do you?

404
00:36:38,268 --> 00:36:39,969
It was only last year when we came.

405
00:36:46,704 --> 00:36:50,908
I think everything is fine, it's okay.

406
00:36:51,246 --> 00:36:52,580
He can continue teaching you.

407
00:36:52,611 --> 00:36:56,814
And he remember you. Let's continue with the Padme Hokkien.

408
00:36:57,736 --> 00:36:58,736
Next time, could you just

409
00:36:59,044 --> 00:37:00,813
go with the flow first, understand?

410
00:37:01,585 --> 00:37:06,190
Let me take a photo for you, cooking together.

411
00:37:11,357 --> 00:37:12,424
Daiji.

412
00:37:13,259 --> 00:37:16,262
I think Tao Sor's had enough, take him to rest.

413
00:37:16,595 --> 00:37:17,768
Okay, come!

414
00:37:26,104 --> 00:37:27,405
Apologies.

415
00:37:27,912 --> 00:37:30,715
The chef is not usually be like this.

416
00:37:31,629 --> 00:37:34,065
Maybe he is not feeling well today.

417
00:37:37,835 --> 00:37:40,136
Tell you clients they can order anything

418
00:37:40,254 --> 00:37:41,528
I'll take care of the charges.

419
00:37:42,541 --> 00:37:45,357
As for the contract, I still cannot sign it.

420
00:37:47,193 --> 00:37:50,196
I told you from the beginning that our chef wasn't ready.

421
00:38:11,429 --> 00:38:12,997
Hey.

422
00:38:13,997 --> 00:38:15,119
What are you doing here alone?

423
00:38:15,426 --> 00:38:16,628
Don't you have class?

424
00:38:18,037 --> 00:38:18,923
I went already.

425
00:38:19,269 --> 00:38:20,836
Such a waste of time, learning who knows what.

426
00:38:20,906 --> 00:38:22,813
Better to use the time making content.

427
00:38:23,173 --> 00:38:24,575
What about you? What are you doing?

428
00:38:26,096 --> 00:38:27,898
I'm just ...

429
00:38:29,101 --> 00:38:30,135
..taking a stroll.

430
00:38:30,789 --> 00:38:32,424
Just taking a stroll.

431
00:38:34,640 --> 00:38:36,375
That was bad acting.

432
00:38:39,804 --> 00:38:41,372
Like you'd know.

433
00:38:43,082 --> 00:38:44,650
It's just..

434
00:38:45,303 --> 00:38:46,772
I don't wann go back home yet.

435
00:38:47,753 --> 00:38:49,554
I don't wanna deal with Sang's questions.

436
00:38:49,555 --> 00:38:51,256
Which means,

437
00:38:51,257 --> 00:38:54,259
today's trip wasn't good.

438
00:38:54,260 --> 00:38:55,494
Aren't I right.

439
00:38:57,168 --> 00:39:00,038
I shouldn't have went with that Precious Resort.

440
00:39:01,412 --> 00:39:02,547
That Chef Tao Sor,

441
00:39:03,677 --> 00:39:05,678
his skills are good, that's true

442
00:39:05,703 --> 00:39:06,971
but unprofessional.

443
00:39:07,718 --> 00:39:08,718
Chef Tao Sor...

444
00:39:09,454 --> 00:39:12,377
Oh! The youngest son of The Pitch or something?

445
00:39:13,078 --> 00:39:15,246
I've heard people talk,

446
00:39:15,247 --> 00:39:18,249
that the youngest son had disappeared for a while.

447
00:39:18,250 --> 00:39:19,651
And once he came back,

448
00:39:19,652 --> 00:39:21,220
he didn't really go anywhere.

449
00:39:22,813 --> 00:39:24,648
Some people have also said

450
00:39:25,129 --> 00:39:26,397
he was harrased.

451
00:39:26,974 --> 00:39:28,993
Other people say,

452
00:39:29,353 --> 00:39:30,554
he drowned.

453
00:39:32,256 --> 00:39:33,991
Until his brain wasn't normal.

454
00:39:36,081 --> 00:39:38,979
But, no one's ever confirmed what the real story is

455
00:39:39,004 --> 00:39:42,007
and his family doesn't say much either.

456
00:39:43,976 --> 00:39:45,311
Really?

457
00:39:50,916 --> 00:39:53,351
Would you want to get your fortune told?

458
00:39:53,352 --> 00:39:55,853
Your business might blow up, you know.

459
00:39:55,854 --> 00:39:57,855
No, that's enough.

460
00:39:57,856 --> 00:40:01,059
Just being trapped her for a year because of a feng shui master's tellings

461
00:40:01,412 --> 00:40:03,347
it's already driving me crazy.

462
00:40:03,955 --> 00:40:06,507
- Stop. With the fortune tellers, stop
- Listen first!

463
00:40:06,532 --> 00:40:08,519
This one's for real, I gurantee.

464
00:40:08,586 --> 00:40:11,589
- No, no
- Hey!

465
00:40:13,172 --> 00:40:16,608
That's why his luck's down, he hasn't even checked it yet.

466
00:40:52,269 --> 00:40:54,038
Look, you.

467
00:40:55,360 --> 00:40:57,095
Why are you sitting here alone?

468
00:41:01,232 --> 00:41:04,035
I’m just sitting here watching the sunset.

469
00:41:40,294 --> 00:41:41,414
Are you afraid of the ocean?

470
00:41:45,126 --> 00:41:48,194
'll bring you out there. Trust me.

471
00:41:53,614 --> 00:41:55,382
I've never been in the ocean before.

472
00:41:58,106 --> 00:42:02,077
In that case, there might be another way.

473
00:42:16,798 --> 00:42:20,468
I’ll be the one who becomes your memory

